1️⃣ Remove Outermost Parentheses
Pattern: Greedy + Depth Counter
Single pass traversal
Make a local decision (keep / skip) based on current depth
No backtracking, no extra stack

2️⃣ Reverse Words in a String / Palindrome Check
Pattern:
Word-based string processing
Two Pointer (for palindrome)

3️⃣ Largest Odd Number in a String
Pattern: Greedy + Single Pass
Scan from right to left
First odd digit guarantees the largest possible odd number
Early stopping (greedy choice)

4️⃣ Longest Common Prefix
Pattern: Prefix Scanning / Horizontal Comparison
Compare characters at the same index across all strings
Stop immediately on mismatch
No hashing or frequency counting involved

🧠 Key Learning (Day 7)
Many string problems follow repeatable patterns
Greedy works when decisions are final and irreversible
Prefix problems depend on position, not frequency

